\newlabel{fig LCOH curve}{{2}{6}{\textbf {Offshore green hydrogen cost-supply curves by country and year.} \textbf {a--c}, National cost-supply curves for 2030, 2040 and 2050, respectively. Solid lines denote countries. Markers on Ireland's and the UK's curves indicate their offshore wind capacity targets. Grey shading shows the projected blue-hydrogen cost range}{figure.8}{}}
