\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {7}{\ignorespaces \textbf  {Counterfactual allocation and import-price sensitivity identify the strategic-exporter pattern.} \textbf  {a} Country net-export balance under a lowest-LCOH-only baseline and the integrated model in 2030, 2040 and 2050. Blue indicates net export and red indicates net import. Black boxes mark the leading net exporter in each model-year combination; labels inside the boxes give the leading exporter and corresponding net export in TWh yr$^{-1}$. \textbf  {b} Carbon-mitigation attribution shifts from international imports to European offshore suppliers as the international hydrogen-equivalent import price increases, shown for 2030, 2040 and 2050. \textbf  {c} Country net-export trajectories across the 30--105 \texteuro {} MWh$^{-1}$ response range. Each country has three horizontal trajectories for 2030, 2040 and 2050. Line colour indicates the international hydrogen-equivalent import price along each trajectory; endpoint marker shape and line position identify the model year.}}{12}{figure.20}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig nc lcoh counterfactual}{{7}{12}{\textbf {Counterfactual allocation and import-price sensitivity identify the strategic-exporter pattern.} \textbf {a} Country net-export balance under a lowest-LCOH-only baseline and the integrated model in 2030, 2040 and 2050. Blue indicates net export and red indicates net import. Black boxes mark the leading net exporter in each model-year combination; labels inside the boxes give the leading exporter and corresponding net export in TWh yr$^{-1}$. \textbf {b} Carbon-mitigation attribution shifts from international imports to European offshore suppliers as the international hydrogen-equivalent import price increases, shown for 2030, 2040 and 2050. \textbf {c} Country net-export trajectories across the 30--105 \texteuro {} MWh$^{-1}$ response range. Each country has three horizontal trajectories for 2030, 2040 and 2050. Line colour indicates the international hydrogen-equivalent import price along each trajectory; endpoint marker shape and line position identify the model year}{figure.20}{}}
